<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Notation and Definitions</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Symbols and Abbreviations</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<ul id="A1.I1" class="ltx_itemize ltx_leftmargin_flush">
<li id="A1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{Q}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒬</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{Q}</annotation></semantics></math>: the query space from which tasks are sampled.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}_{\text{MultiTask}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mtext>MultiTask</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}_{\text{MultiTask}}</annotation></semantics></math>: dataset consisting of <math id="A1.I1.i2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> subtasks with known ground truths (e.g., multiple-choice, fill-in-the-blank, short-answer).</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}_{\text{SingleTask}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mtext>SingleTask</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}_{\text{SingleTask}}</annotation></semantics></math>: dataset of structured scientific proposal prompts without ground truth, each consisting of three required paragraphs.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L_{p}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L_{p}</annotation></semantics></math>: the number of <em id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">player agents</em> (pretrained LLMs generating candidate responses). In our experiments <math id="A1.I1.i4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L_{p}=9" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L_{p}=9</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L_{g}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L_{g}</annotation></semantics></math>: the number of <em id="A1.I1.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">grader agents</em> forming the AI Committee (evaluators of player responses). In our experiments <math id="A1.I1.i5.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L_{g}=4" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L_{g}=4</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i6.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i6.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A^{P}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>P</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A^{P}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>: the <math id="A1.I1.i6.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math>-th player agent, producing a response <math id="A1.I1.i6.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> given an input query.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i7" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i7.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i7.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i7.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A^{G}_{l}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>G</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A^{G}_{l}</annotation></semantics></math>: the <math id="A1.I1.i7.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="l" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>l</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">l</annotation></semantics></math>-th grader agent, producing an evaluation score and uncertainty tuple <math id="A1.I1.i7.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(s_{l},u_{l})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(s_{l},u_{l})</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i8" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i8.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i8.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i8.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A^{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>F</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A^{F}</annotation></semantics></math>: the <em id="A1.I1.i8.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">fusion agent</em>, which synthesizes a final consensus answer from all player responses using the confidence-weight table.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i9" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i9.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i9.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i9.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q^{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>q</mi><mi>j</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q^{j}</annotation></semantics></math>: the query (or query batch) at round <math id="A1.I1.i9.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j\in\{1,\dots,R\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j\in\{1,\dots,R\}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i10" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i10.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i10.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i10.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k^{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>k</mi><mi>j</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k^{j}</annotation></semantics></math>: the corresponding reference answers (available only in MultiTask).</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i11" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i11.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i11.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i11.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{i}^{j}=A^{P}_{i}(q^{j})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>P</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mi>j</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{i}^{j}=A^{P}_{i}(q^{j})</annotation></semantics></math>: the response generated by player <math id="A1.I1.i11.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math> in round <math id="A1.I1.i11.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>j</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i12" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i12.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i12.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i12.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r^{j}=\bigcup_{i=1}^{L_{p}}r_{i}^{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi></msup><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>⋃</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></msubsup><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r^{j}=\bigcup_{i=1}^{L_{p}}r_{i}^{j}</annotation></semantics></math>: the pool of all responses in round <math id="A1.I1.i12.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>j</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i13" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i13.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i13.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i13.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(s_{l}^{j},u_{l}^{j})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>j</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>j</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(s_{l}^{j},u_{l}^{j})</annotation></semantics></math>: the score and uncertainty provided by grader <math id="A1.I1.i13.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="l" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>l</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">l</annotation></semantics></math> for round <math id="A1.I1.i13.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>j</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i14" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i14.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i14.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i14.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(s^{j},u^{j})=\frac{1}{L_{g}}\sum_{l=1}^{L_{g}}(s_{l}^{j},u_{l}^{j})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>j</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>j</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>j</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>j</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(s^{j},u^{j})=\frac{1}{L_{g}}\sum_{l=1}^{L_{g}}(s_{l}^{j},u_{l}^{j})</annotation></semantics></math>: the aggregated committee evaluation for round <math id="A1.I1.i14.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>j</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i15" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i15.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i15.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i15.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\vartheta\in\mathbb{R}^{L_{p}\times N}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϑ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\vartheta\in\mathbb{R}^{L_{p}\times N}</annotation></semantics></math>: the <em id="A1.I1.i15.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">confidence-weight table</em>, a matrix storing trust weights for each player and subtask/rubric dimension.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i16" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i16.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i16.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I1.i16.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{r}^{j}=A^{F}(r^{j},\vartheta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>F</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>ϑ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{r}^{j}=A^{F}(r^{j},\vartheta)</annotation></semantics></math>: the fused consensus response in round <math id="A1.I1.i16.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>j</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
