</span></span></span>
<span id="A3.T4.4.1.1.1.1.1.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:1pt;padding-bottom:1pt;">
<span id="A3.T4.4.1.1.1.1.1.1.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:213.4pt;">
<span id="A3.T4.4.1.1.1.1.1.1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="A3.T4.4.1.1.1.1.1.1.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Janet’s ducks lay 16 eggs per day. She consumes 3 eggs for breakfast, uses 4 eggs for baking muffins, and sells the remaining eggs at $2 each. How much does she earn at the farmers’ market?</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A3.T4.4.1.1.1.1.1.1.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:1pt;padding-bottom:1pt;">
