<span id="A3.T4.4.1.1.1.1.1.1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Display strong arithmetic and logical sequencing skills to compute the final earnings.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A3.T4.4.1.1.1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
