<span id="A3.T4.4.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Demonstrate the ability to interpret stratigraphic evidence and correctly apply the principle of superposition.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A3.T4.4.1.1.1.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A3.T4.4.1.1.1.1.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t ltx_colspan ltx_colspan_2" style="padding-top:1pt;padding-bottom:1pt;"><span id="A3.T4.4.1.1.1.1.1.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:156.5pt;">
