<span id="A3.T4.p4.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A3.T4.p4.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:1pt;padding-bottom:1pt;">Macro Mechanics</span></span>
<span id="A3.T4.p4.1.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A3.T4.p4.1.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:1pt;padding-bottom:1pt;"><span id="A3.T4.p4.1.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">Task 001: Mech. 1</span></span></span>
</span></span><span id="A3.T4.p4.1.3" class="ltx_text"></span></span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A3.T4.4.1.1.1.1.1.1.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:1pt;padding-bottom:1pt;">
<span id="A3.T4.4.1.1.1.1.1.1.5.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:213.4pt;">
<span id="A3.T4.4.1.1.1.1.1.1.5.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="A3.T4.4.1.1.1.1.1.1.5.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">What is elasticity? What is strain energy? How do we make use of high elastic modulus materials?</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A3.T4.4.1.1.1.1.1.1.5.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:1pt;padding-bottom:1pt;">
<span id="A3.T4.4.1.1.1.1.1.1.5.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:213.4pt;">
<span id="A3.T4.4.1.1.1.1.1.1.5.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Explain fundamental mechanical properties and their practical applications in structural design.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A3.T4.4.1.1.1.1.1.1.6" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A3.T4.4.1.1.1.1.1.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle" style="padding-top:1pt;padding-bottom:1pt;"></span>
<span id="A3.T4.4.1.1.1.1.1.1.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:1pt;padding-bottom:1pt;"><span id="A3.T4.4.1.1.1.1.1.1.6.2.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:85.4pt;">
<span id="A3.T4.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent ltx_align_center">
<span id="A3.T4.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T4.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span> <span id="A3.T4.p5.1.2" class="ltx_text">
<span id="A3.T4.p5.1.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A3.T4.p5.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A3.T4.p5.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:1pt;padding-bottom:1pt;">Micro Mechanics</span></span>
<span id="A3.T4.p5.1.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
